  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2718c5863d8c65a4aa712d078446307f, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - Woah, hey there! Were are you comming from!
  - Aren't you like a domestic pigs those humans keep?
  - You don't know how you came here? Are you sure you want to go back?
  - I sure enjoy some of the junk food of those humans, but the fruits of the roots
    in this forest are great too!
  - Well, take a look around! You'll find me somewhere to the north of that lovely
    stream!
